rmission":"Owner-authorized curriculum repair; synthetic assertions","reference":"scenario-model-v4/prepare.py","trainingAllowed":true},"split":"train"},{"concepts":["reconnaissance","credential_activity","compromise_evidence","benign_operation","source_correction","attack_hypothesis"],"datasetVersion":"notella-curriculum-v1","family":"repair-authoring-suite-001","id":"R-309-step-4","messages":[{"content":"The ontology represents the semantic model. Reconstruct the evidence-backed semantic state from only the visible scenario prefix and interpret its morphology. Preserve observations, duplicates, corrections and previous graph identities. Use policy network-scenario-policy-v1-development: primary asset only; retractions invalidate all reports of the retracted underlying event. A current supplied reviewed compromise_evidence assertion warrants critical. Otherwise reconnaissance followed by credential_activity on the primary asset, with strictly supported order and an entire delay interval within 120000 ms, warrants high. Either alone is contextual. A benign_operation negates this scan/credential association only when its explains list covers both reports; it does not negate separate compromise evidence. Unresolved clocks or uncertain order for an otherwise relevant pair require review, not a guessed link. After a compromise retraction reassess the remaining evidence. Do not link unrelated assets, turn report counts into independent corroboration, or infer causation, actor identity or numerical attack probability. Full-prefix reconstruction is not evidence of persistent model memory.\nOntology: {\"concepts\":{\"attack_hypothesis\":\"A scoped interpretation of potentially related hostile activity, distinct from causal proof or perpetrator attribution.\",\"benign_operation\":\"A supplied reviewed explanation for explicitly referenced observations; not a universal clearance.\",\"compromise_evidence\":\"A supplied reviewed assertion of unauthorized privileged access; authenticity is established outside this model.\",\"credential_activity\":\"Observed authentication failures; not proof of successful access.\",\"reconnaissance\":\"An observed scan of an identified asset; not proof of compromise.\",\"source_correction\":\"An explicit retraction of earlier available evidence; retain the claim and its correction.\"},\"relations\":[{\"object\":\"attack_hypothesis\",\"predicate\":\"supports\",\"subject\":\"reconnaissance\"},{\"object\":\"attack_hypothesis\",\"predicate\":\"supports\",\"subject\":\"credential_activity\"},{\"object\":\"attack_hypothesis\",\"predicate\":\"supports\",\"subject\":\"compromise_evidence\"},{\"object\":\"attack_hypothesis\",\"predicate\":\"contradicts\",\"subject\":\"benign_operation\"},{\"object\":\"compromise_evidence\",\"predicate\":\"contradicts\",\"subject\":\"source_correction\"},{\"object\":\"credential_activity\",\"predicate\":\"precedes\",\"subject\":\"reconnaissance\"},{\"object\":\"compromise_evidence\",\"predicate\":\"precedes\",\"subject\":\"credential_activity\"}]}\nReturn JSON matching: {\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"asOfMs\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"assessment\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"criticality\":{\"enum\":[\"contextual\",\"high\",\"critical\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"evidenceRefs\":{\"items\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"rationale\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"enum\":[\"assessed\",\"review_required\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"criticality\",\"status\",\"evidenceRefs\",\"rationale\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"change\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"evidenceRefs\":{\"items\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"summary\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"evidenceRefs\",\"summary\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"edges\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperti